(252789, 16991, 1863, '<td valign="top">Another very norty shot! Hehehe, something I would have done when I was a kid! I like the use of shallow DOF here. Great job, well done.</td>', 'Another very norty shot! Hehehe, something I would have done when I was a kid! I like the use of shallow DOF here. Great job, well done.', '2003-04-02 12:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
