(252795, 16907, 1863, '<td valign="top">I did this to my father once! He got sooooo angry. anyway, hehe. I like this shot, great shallow dof, quite appropriate in this picture. The light seems a tab bit too bright on the top of the salt grinder, but eh, does that matter? not really :) The idea of mischief in this shot is great.</td>', 'I did this to my father once! He got sooooo angry. anyway, hehe. I like this shot, great shallow dof, quite appropriate in this picture. The light seems a tab bit too bright on the top of the salt grinder, but eh, does that matter? not really :) The idea of mischief in this shot is great.', '2003-04-02 12:28:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(252796, 16930, 1863, '<td valign="top">hehe, the classical middle finger in a box joke! I feel so loved when I see this picture. I think it would have been funnier if I couldn''t see the finger under the box too! Great gross out factor. hehe</td>', 'hehe, the classical middle finger in a box joke! I feel so loved when I see this picture. I think it would have been funnier if I couldn''t see the finger under the box too! Great gross out factor. hehe', '2003-04-02 12:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(252801, 16973, 1863, '<td valign="top">hehehe. how many times have I tried to startle somebody like that? it never works. she''d see you in the glare of the monitor and through the glasses. Great candid shot, even though it looks a bit staged! NORTY! hehe. great fun</td>', 'hehehe. how many times have I tried to startle somebody like that? it never works. she''d see you in the glare of the monitor and through the glasses. Great candid shot, even though it looks a bit staged! NORTY! hehe. great fun', '2003-04-02 12:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
