(252803, 16916, 1863, '<td valign="top">You know.. I''ve slipped on a banana peel in england. I was walking home from university, and I saw a banana peel on the ground, from afar, and I ignored it.. except, when I got closer, my boobies obstructed the view, and I stepped on it, and whamo, I was on the floor! darn that hurt... and all the drivers on the side of the road got a free view. ANYWAY! on to the picture. Very cute... Good choice of desaturation of the rest of the colours. did you try any white balance? that white wall on the right is a pain in the bum.</td>', 'You know.. I''ve slipped on a banana peel in england. I was walking home from university, and I saw a banana peel on the ground, from afar, and I ignored it.. except, when I got closer, my boobies obstructed the view, and I stepped on it, and whamo, I was on the floor! darn that hurt... and all the drivers on the side of the road got a free view. ANYWAY! on to the picture. Very cute... Good choice of desaturation of the rest of the colours. did you try any white balance? that white wall on the right is a pain in the bum.', '2003-04-02 12:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(252805, 16952, 1863, '<td valign="top">Heh, leaves a lot to the imagination. This shot could have been improved by letting us know more precisely what happened to her. I''m a stickler for stuff like that! :) NORTY shot!</td>', 'Heh, leaves a lot to the imagination. This shot could have been improved by letting us know more precisely what happened to her. I''m a stickler for stuff like that! :) NORTY shot!', '2003-04-02 12:48:53.000000', NULL, 1),
