(254058, 16973, 3585, '<td valign="top">A grand classic well illustrated</td>', 'A grand classic well illustrated', '2003-04-04 08:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(254145, 16905, 5266, '<td valign="top">I don''t understand this at all.  Can''t you dial from handset #2?  I can.  <br/>EDIT:  OK - I get it - I didn''t notice it at first because my number pad is the same way and actually I often type the numbers in the wrong order because of it!!  LOL!!</td>', 'I don''t understand this at all.  Can''t you dial from handset #2?  I can.  EDIT:  OK - I get it - I didn''t notice it at first because my number pad is the same way and actually I often type the numbers in the wrong order because of it!!  LOL!!', '2003-04-04 12:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(254304, 16930, 3317, '<td valign="top">well-executed presentation of a classic.</td>', 'well-executed presentation of a classic.', '2003-04-04 15:40:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(254311, 16986, 6458, '<td valign="top">Okay.. while I''m not a big fan of the Joke here, I''m really a sucker for a good pan. This constitutes a good pan. The green makes it a bit surreal too. Good job.</td>', 'Okay.. while I''m not a big fan of the Joke here, I''m really a sucker for a good pan. This constitutes a good pan. The green makes it a bit surreal too. Good job.', '2003-04-04 16:00:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(254313, 16983, 6458, '<td valign="top">The picture isn''t all that great. It''s the extra editing you''ve done that really sets this apart and makes it funny.  Good!</td>', 'The picture isn''t all that great. It''s the extra editing you''ve done that really sets this apart and makes it funny.  Good!', '2003-04-04 16:03:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(254316, 16978, 6458, '<td valign="top">The pic is okay. The nice bit is the lens flare on the tack. Reminds me of a WB cartoon. :)</td>', 'The pic is okay. The nice bit is the lens flare on the tack. Reminds me of a WB cartoon. :)', '2003-04-04 16:05:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(254331, 16986, 3317, '<td valign="top">nice to see a shot of a prank that actually occurred... the green and feathers weren''t added digitally, right? nice framing of a moving subject, you''ve got quick reflexes. nine for you.</td>', 'nice to see a shot of a prank that actually occurred... the green and feathers weren''t added digitally, right? nice framing of a moving subject, you''ve got quick reflexes. nine for you.', '2003-04-04 17:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(254335, 16952, 3317, '<td valign="top">she really does look like a victim, definately non-plussed. can''t say it''s the most stunning portrait i''ve ever seen, but it sure does capture a mood. would be interested in seeing the color version, i always wonder what folks are trying to achieve by stripping the color away. maybe more stark and spooky? seven for you.</td>', 'she really does look like a victim, definately non-plussed. can''t say it''s the most stunning portrait i''ve ever seen, but it sure does capture a mood. would be interested in seeing the color version, i always wonder what folks are trying to achieve by stripping the color away. maybe more stark and spooky? seven for you.', '2003-04-04 17:35:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(254336, 16959, 3317, '<td valign="top">this is a sweet macro shot. not to be a jerk, but if the title''s got to be that long to get your point across, you might want to go back to the photo, having the image say it all is the best.</td>', 'this is a sweet macro shot. not to be a jerk, but if the title''s got to be that long to get your point across, you might want to go back to the photo, having the image say it all is the best.', '2003-04-04 17:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
