(254510, 16939, 5792, '<td valign="top">Annida,<br/> <br/>Congratulations on breaking the "6" barrier! 7th place. Wow! A really great photograph! I gave you a "6" myself.<br/> <br/>I agree with all the good things others said about this image. You are one terrific photographer and having a better camera does make a difference for someone as creative and unique as you. It allows you to express yourself better.</td>', 'Annida, Congratulations on breaking the "6" barrier! 7th place. Wow! A really great photograph! I gave you a "6" myself. I agree with all the good things others said about this image. You are one terrific photographer and having a better camera does make a difference for someone as creative and unique as you. It allows you to express yourself better.', '2003-04-05 01:29:18.000000', NULL, 0),
