(254536, 16939, 1037, '<td valign="top">YAY ANNIDA!!!!!<br/> <br/>*Jumps up and down for joy*.</td>', 'YAY ANNIDA!!!!! *Jumps up and down for joy*.', '2003-04-05 04:46:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(254543, 16925, 6458, '<td valign="top">*sigh*. I''m so darn creative and so ahead of everyone else that they just don''t understand me... <br/> <br/>err.. Well, what can I say. Last. I''m proud of that!  Now all I need is a first place ribbon and I''ll have experienced all that DPC has to offer! I''m surprised the score was as high as it was..  <br/> <br/>For those that didn''t get it - This was a photograph that was entirely spot edited. Submitted as a Practical Joke on all those who take this too seriously (including myself!).</td>', '*sigh*. I''m so darn creative and so ahead of everyone else that they just don''t understand me...  err.. Well, what can I say. Last. I''m proud of that!  Now all I need is a first place ribbon and I''ll have experienced all that DPC has to offer! I''m surprised the score was as high as it was..   For those that didn''t get it - This was a photograph that was entirely spot edited. Submitted as a Practical Joke on all those who take this too seriously (including myself!).', '2003-04-05 05:14:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(254545, 16926, 6458, '<td valign="top">Damn! You beat me! *grumble*      Nice pic anyway!</td>', 'Damn! You beat me! *grumble*      Nice pic anyway!', '2003-04-05 05:18:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(254546, 16916, 6458, '<td valign="top">Congrats Mav!</td>', 'Congrats Mav!', '2003-04-05 05:20:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(254548, 16907, 2780, '<td valign="top">Incase anyone is interested, here is the photoshop work I did:<br/> <br/>Resize,<br/>Convert to sepia,<br/>Levels adjustments. <br/>(These are the legal bits)<br/> <br/>then:<br/> <br/>Used the distort resize tool to make the mug appear bigger and straighter,<br/>Selected the areas of the floor, which were too similar in colour to the mug, and lightened them.<br/>(These are the NON-legal bits)<br/> <br/> <br/>Then I submitted.<br/> <br/></td>', 'Incase anyone is interested, here is the photoshop work I did: Resize,Convert to sepia,Levels adjustments. (These are the legal bits) then: Used the distort resize tool to make the mug appear bigger and straighter,Selected the areas of the floor, which were too similar in colour to the mug, and lightened them.(These are the NON-legal bits)  Then I submitted. ', '2003-04-05 06:44:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(254552, 16958, 3585, '<td valign="top">Only 9th! Photographically, graphically, this one was it in this challenge. I have a feeling these criteria fall, now and then, into complete obsolescence.</td>', 'Only 9th! Photographically, graphically, this one was it in this challenge. I have a feeling these criteria fall, now and then, into complete obsolescence.', '2003-04-05 07:23:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(254554, 16978, 3084, '<td valign="top">You deserved to win with this image, great work</td>', 'You deserved to win with this image, great work', '2003-04-05 07:38:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(254565, 16947, 5792, '<td valign="top">Sonifo,  Ho, Hum... just another brilliant image from a gifted, mega-talented photographer. (People like you disgust me) You just keep getting better and better.</td>', 'Sonifo,  Ho, Hum... just another brilliant image from a gifted, mega-talented photographer. (People like you disgust me) You just keep getting better and better.', '2003-04-05 09:03:02.000000', NULL, 0),
