(254598, 16905, 3161, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments - in case anyone is still wondering what the point is ... Have you ever dialed a phone without looking at the numbers - because you know just where they are? Well, try doing that on this phone ... you might get a wrong number ...<br/> <br/>I don''t know why telephone keypads (at least in the USA) and computer keyboard numeric pads are different from each other, but it can be confusing!</td>', 'Thanks for the comments - in case anyone is still wondering what the point is ... Have you ever dialed a phone without looking at the numbers - because you know just where they are? Well, try doing that on this phone ... you might get a wrong number ... I don''t know why telephone keypads (at least in the USA) and computer keyboard numeric pads are different from each other, but it can be confusing!', '2003-04-05 11:31:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(254600, 16986, 714, '<td valign="top">YOu did a excellent job!!  This was my favorite of the challenge.</td>', 'YOu did a excellent job!!  This was my favorite of the challenge.', '2003-04-05 11:35:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(254601, 16958, 472, '<td valign="top">Thanks for voting/commenting :) . My pic was supposed to represent someone who is always picked on, and their feelings of alienation and dejection.  Rather a dark theme for DPC.  My original title was also ''Pathetic Loser'', but at the last minute I changed it.  Only later, did I realize the connection to pinching a rear-end, reinforced by the title. In my mind, the pinching just meant a nasty pinch on the arm.  I''m happy with this image, tho. :)</td>', 'Thanks for voting/commenting :) . My pic was supposed to represent someone who is always picked on, and their feelings of alienation and dejection.  Rather a dark theme for DPC.  My original title was also ''Pathetic Loser'', but at the last minute I changed it.  Only later, did I realize the connection to pinching a rear-end, reinforced by the title. In my mind, the pinching just meant a nasty pinch on the arm.  I''m happy with this image, tho. :)', '2003-04-05 11:45:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(254603, 16947, 714, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all your kind comments!!!  It is only a joke.  I don''t think of any of you as an.... well you know.  I hope you had fun with it, I did.  I was going to use a clown for the picture, but couldn''t find a picture of a good clown.<br/> <br/>I printed out a picture of the lovely donkey in a polariod shape and then stuck the picture in the camera.  I then took a picture of the camera with a black background.  I went in to PSP and put the flare on the flash.  It was a real easy shot.  <br/></td>', 'Thanks for all your kind comments!!!  It is only a joke.  I don''t think of any of you as an.... well you know.  I hope you had fun with it, I did.  I was going to use a clown for the picture, but couldn''t find a picture of a good clown. I printed out a picture of the lovely donkey in a polariod shape and then stuck the picture in the camera.  I then took a picture of the camera with a black background.  I went in to PSP and put the flare on the flash.  It was a real easy shot.  ', '2003-04-05 11:48:39.000000', NULL, 0),
