(254690, 16952, 3585, '<td valign="top">OK, I agree, this was not a very nice comment. your picture was actually rather interesting and deserved a better ranking. It looks like you used "NeatImage" or something to get wrid of noise, and that poor women face complection realy went to hell. Stay away from these filters when it comes to human skin, grain ad noise can have some charm.</td>', 'OK, I agree, this was not a very nice comment. your picture was actually rather interesting and deserved a better ranking. It looks like you used "NeatImage" or something to get wrid of noise, and that poor women face complection realy went to hell. Stay away from these filters when it comes to human skin, grain ad noise can have some charm.', '2003-04-05 15:30:41.000000', NULL, 0),
